    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest... yeah. that sounds like the only thing that actually makes sense. everything else is just noise. but the noise doesn't really stop, does it? even when you're alone, it's still there. how do you actually find a space like that? one where you don't have to be anywhere or anything ever again?",
